# Files `git archive` leaves out, so `make plugin` ships only what an installed
# plugin needs. Development tooling and CI config would otherwise land on every
# customer's DSS instance -- pyrightconfig.json in particular records local paths.
#
# Kept in the zip on purpose: plugin.json, python-lib/, python-llms/,
# parameter-sets/, README.md, CHANGELOG.md (surfaced by the plugin store) and
# LICENSE (the grant itself, and Apache-2.0 section 4(a) for the build files).

tests/              export-ignore
.github/            export-ignore
Makefile            export-ignore
pyrightconfig.json  export-ignore
.gitignore          export-ignore
.gitattributes      export-ignore
.mailmap            export-ignore
